== 1 per-document noise s = SE*sqrt(docs) and q = s/|log r| (pairs 0.5% <= |log r| <= 15%; move1 = a 3.00 -> 3.50 group move vs V2 3.00, move2 = two disjoint group moves (a swap-like pair), c / x = other pairs)
